1
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:49,200
Why did you betray Hades?

2
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:50,640
And kill our comrades?

3
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:52,239
Hades...

4
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:54,040
He gave us a new life.

5
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:56,799
We must fight to the end for his cause!

6
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:01,920
You know what? Charon isn't even my real name.

7
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:04,680
My name is Qin Huan.

8
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,840
I'm Chinese.

9
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,159
A tourist kidnapped by the Hades Syndicate.

10
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:14,599
They captured me, controlled me,

11
00:02:15,319 --> 00:02:17,680
and trained me as an assassin to kill for them.

12
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,039
"Comrades"? That's ridiculous.

13
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:25,680
And do you even know who you all are?

14
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:28,439
Do you know who you really are?

15
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,560
Do you?

16
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,639
Speak up!

17
00:02:45,439 --> 00:02:46,240
Bastard!

18
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,039
Bastard!

19
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,159
Move, move, hurry!

20
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:51,879
Charon

21
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,159
is an assassin for Hades.

22
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,599
And this man

23
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:04,960
is a cellist in a symphony orchestra.

24
00:03:06,719 --> 00:03:07,520
Right.

25
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:10,319
I just received Qin Huan's file.

26
00:03:10,879 --> 00:03:11,680
This is what

27
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,919
a neighboring country found while compiling

28
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:14,680
missing persons cases.

29
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,680
At first,

30
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,400
I didn't connect the two of them either.

31
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,439
Then I noticed something.

32
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:24,000
So I made a bold deduction.

33
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,039
Look.

34
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,919
He has this habitual movement here.

35
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:33,759
His left wrist and index finger

36
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:35,840
always form an open fist at a 90-degree angle.

37
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:38,240
That's a cellist's muscle memory.

38
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,520
Even if his mind remembers nothing,

39
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:42,240
his body will still remember the motion.

40
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,240
Qin Huan

41
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,400
and Charon

42
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,120
really look like the same person.

43
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,520
Then it's very likely

44
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,400
the intel I received back then was fake.

45
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,800
Back then, the police said

46
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:05,240
Rosie's boyfriend was killed in an explosion.

47
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,919
Charon's past is a complete blank.

48
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:11,439
He suddenly appeared two years ago,

49
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,639
just like how

50
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:16,920
Qin Huan suddenly vanished four years ago.

51
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,800
Thank you.

52
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,800
Xiang Bei,

53
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,120
do me a favor.

54
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:35,720
I'd like to use Zhong An's official channels

55
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,839
to help me at the embassy

56
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:39,120
get a passport for Rosie.

57
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,600
Sure, leave it to me.

58
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:43,120
Thank you.

59
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,519
If we die, we die together.

60
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:15,519
You can't die, and neither will I.

61
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,120
Both of us have to live.

62
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,319
We must survive to see each other again.

63
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:28,319
Captain.

64
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:30,879
How come you're being so nice today,

65
00:05:31,199 --> 00:05:32,120
buying me a drink?

66
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,600
Rosie, let me ask you something.

67
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:41,319
That guy you danced with the other night...

68
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,720
Do you know who he was?

69
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:46,800
No.

70
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,240
Didn't he seem familiar?

71
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,800
To be exact...

72
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,240
it was more like a sense of closeness.

73
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,879
And that feeling of closeness...

74
00:05:58,879 --> 00:06:01,639
Do you know where it came from?

75
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:08,639
No.

76
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,000
I just feel...

77
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:13,319
he must know about my past.

78
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,519
I once heard...

79
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,800
that same cello sound,

80
00:06:18,759 --> 00:06:19,959
that same melody,

81
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:22,160
on an afternoon just like that.

82
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,439
Except the air...

83
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:26,959
was filled with the smell of gunpowder.

84
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,879
I know you guys...

85
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,399
might have uncovered something.

86
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,560
But I don't want to know.

87
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:40,399
I'm begging you, please don't tell me.

88
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:43,519
You can't avoid the truth, Rosie.

89
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,839
Captain and I both think you have to know.

90
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,920
Rosie.

91
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:53,800
My years of...

92
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:57,319
professional sniper instincts tell me...

93
00:06:58,439 --> 00:06:59,720
the man sent to kill you...

94
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:01,279
is him.

95
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:04,120
The intel I received says...

96
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:07,279
he's a top hitman for the Hades Syndicate.

97
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:10,160
He's committed plenty of crimes abroad over the years.

98
00:07:11,639 --> 00:07:12,839
I know there must be...

99
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:13,959
more behind all of this.

100
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,439
But as of right now,

101
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:18,120
he's an extremely dangerous man.

102
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:26,279
Life is beautiful, but it isn't easy.

103
00:07:26,959 --> 00:07:28,519
We don't have the luxury...

104
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,720
to worry about that now.

105
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:32,000
I know, but I'm still a bit worried.

106
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,040
Relax a little, brother.

107
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,040
For Hades!

108
00:07:45,279 --> 00:07:47,000
We will destroy the Silent Protectors!

109
00:07:49,959 --> 00:07:50,759
Grab your weapons!

110
00:08:53,919 --> 00:08:55,440
Cops! Fall back!

111
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,080
Run!

112
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,039
Move!

113
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,919
Go, go, go!

114
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,759
Where is Rosie right now?

115
00:09:25,159 --> 00:09:26,200
We have her exact location.

116
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,399
There's a news report.

117
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,120
In an abandoned factory,

118
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,519
a shootout broke out.

119
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:39,960
Three were killed at the scene, each by a single shot.

120
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,279
The police found

121
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:42,600
a large cache of firearms and ammunition,

122
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,039
and seized a crate of grenades.

123
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:46,559
Witnesses report that on a nearby high-rise,

124
00:09:46,559 --> 00:09:47,919
a sniper was spotted,

125
00:09:47,919 --> 00:09:49,960
who took out the three from long range.

126
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:51,600
More details to follow.

127
00:09:55,919 --> 00:09:56,720
Uncle Qu, look.

128
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,919
There was another sniper here.

129
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:01,919
This guy

130
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:05,200
risked exposing himself just to kill those men.

131
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:06,519
Why would he do that?

132
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,879
You and Wei Tian always suspected this sniper

133
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:12,240
was the one who shot Rosie.

134
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:16,360
But isn't what he's doing now totally bizarre?

135
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:22,320
Looking at the weapons at the scene, you can tell

136
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:24,720
those men worked for Hades.

137
00:10:26,159 --> 00:10:28,519
He's taking on Hades all by himself.

138
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,200
Hades will definitely retaliate.

139
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,240
Hurry!

140
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:26,320
Hurry!

141
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,720
Where's the guy who came in?

142
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,919
I'm asking you, where did he go?

143
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:44,840
Hurry, hurry!

144
00:12:16,399 --> 00:12:17,279
This place

145
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,399
really brings peace of mind.

146
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,720
If there's something you want to say,

147
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:25,720
just say it.

148
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,279
Wei Tian, I have a favor to ask.

149
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:31,919
Protect Rosie.

150
00:12:32,799 --> 00:12:34,440
Let her live a happy life.

151
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:39,840
In what capacity are you asking me to protect her?

152
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:48,440
Right now, I'm an assassin.

153
00:12:49,559 --> 00:12:51,080
The syndicate sent me to kill Rosie.

154
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,960
But while I was investigating her,

155
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,799
in my mind,

156
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,919
flashes of memories kept coming back.

157
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,919
As my investigation went deeper,

158
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:04,919
I slowly started to remember the past.

159
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:08,039
Things between the two of us.

160
00:13:11,159 --> 00:13:12,240
She's my girlfriend.

161
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:15,000
Do you believe me?

162
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,120
Why?

163
00:13:22,639 --> 00:13:23,440
Intuition.

164
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:31,159
Rosie lost part of her memory, too.

165
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,240
And so did you.

166
00:13:35,799 --> 00:13:37,240
Rosie's was caused by an injury.

167
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,279
What about yours?

168
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,639
Hades.

169
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,360
He captured many people, including me.

170
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:49,399
Then he took control of our minds,

171
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:50,840
brainwashed us,

172
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,600
and turned us into killers.

173
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,799
Now, Hades has targeted your Silent Protectors

174
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,399
with a kill order.

175
00:13:57,720 --> 00:14:00,120
He'll eliminate everyone around you, one by one.

176
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:00,919
That's why I want

177
00:14:00,919 --> 00:14:02,399
you to take everyone and leave right away.

178
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,120
I'm not leaving.

179
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:07,720
Anyone around me can go,

180
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:12,120
but until my score with Hades is settled,

181
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,840
I won't leave.

182
00:14:15,639 --> 00:14:17,039
You're Rosie's boyfriend.

183
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,000
You should take her

184
00:14:20,600 --> 00:14:21,919
somewhere safe and happy,

185
00:14:22,399 --> 00:14:23,919
and live your lives.

186
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:55,600
It's impossible. We can't go back.

187
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,320
She's a Silent Protector.

188
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:01,159
A Silent Protector who protects others.

189
00:15:01,159 --> 00:15:02,000
And what about me?

190
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,000
I'm a killer.

191
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:07,399
Whether killing was my choice or not,

192
00:15:07,399 --> 00:15:08,960
my hands are covered in blood.

193
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,399
Covered in innocent blood.

194
00:15:12,519 --> 00:15:14,519
How can I hold her with these hands again?

195
00:15:14,519 --> 00:15:16,600
I can't even face myself.

196
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,399
I just can't.

197
00:15:29,399 --> 00:15:31,039
Where did everyone go so early?

198
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:34,600
Let's grab a bite. It's just the two of us left.

199
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,080
That's a huge piece of bread.

200
00:15:39,919 --> 00:15:42,720
Rosie isn't doing well emotionally right now.

201
00:15:42,919 --> 00:15:44,840
And her situation is getting more dangerous.

202
00:15:45,279 --> 00:15:46,320
What's your plan?

203
00:15:46,799 --> 00:15:47,919
I reached out to Xiang Bei,

204
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:51,600
asking him to use Zhong An's connections

205
00:15:51,919 --> 00:15:55,120
to get Rosie a passport from the embassy.

206
00:15:56,039 --> 00:15:57,360
You want to send her back?

207
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:00,720
Yeah.

208
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:05,000
Only by going back to China

209
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,200
will she be truly safe.

210
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,960
That's the only way, I suppose.

211
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,240
I'll head to the embassy in a bit

212
00:16:17,519 --> 00:16:19,919
to sort out Rosie's paperwork.

213
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,159
All right.

214
00:18:44,039 --> 00:18:45,240
It's the first time

215
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,559
I've heard someone use a bass instrument

216
00:18:46,559 --> 00:18:47,920
to play this piece.

217
00:18:49,039 --> 00:18:52,160
Playing that same melody on a cello

218
00:18:52,559 --> 00:18:54,039
really feels quite different.

219
00:18:55,559 --> 00:18:57,799
It feels deeply melancholic.

220
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,640
The exact same piece,

221
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,519
played on different instruments,

222
00:19:03,519 --> 00:19:04,960
creates a whole new variation,

223
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,079
a completely different flavor.

224
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:08,160
It's just like drinking coffee.

225
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,119
You need to add plenty of sugar

226
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:12,039
to bring out all the different flavors.

227
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,039
Let me show you.

228
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:14,759
Look.

229
00:19:15,319 --> 00:19:17,960
Stack the sugar cubes one by one,

230
00:19:18,799 --> 00:19:21,519
and then put them into the cup.

231
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:34,519
Then pour the coffee over it,

232
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,160
and let the heat of the coffee melt the sugar.

233
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:41,440
That's how you get that bittersweet flavor.

234
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,039
Try it.

235
00:20:44,519 --> 00:20:45,359
Here's your passport.

236
00:20:45,599 --> 00:20:49,319
Xiang Bei got it sorted for you at the embassy.

237
00:20:57,079 --> 00:20:57,880
Ye Wan.

238
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:02,119
My name is Ye Wan.

239
00:21:02,359 --> 00:21:04,960
Yes, your name is Ye Wan.

240
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:09,799
Now that you have your passport,

241
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:10,759
I think...

242
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:15,200
it's time for you to return to China.

243
00:21:15,839 --> 00:21:19,839
Antilocaris isn't worth staying for anymore.

244
00:21:20,039 --> 00:21:24,000
Going back home might help your memory return.

245
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:34,000
I don't know if remembering the past

246
00:21:34,839 --> 00:21:37,000
is a good thing or a bad thing for me.

247
00:21:40,359 --> 00:21:44,000
But everyone should have a past, right?

248
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:47,799
Yes, I think it's a good thing.

249
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:50,599
Thank you, Wei Tian.

250
00:21:51,799 --> 00:21:53,440
I'll give it some serious thought.

251
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,000
Boss.

252
00:22:11,119 --> 00:22:12,359
Charon is out of control.

253
00:22:14,359 --> 00:22:15,599
Such a pity.

254
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:19,519
Charon was such a gifted sniper.

255
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:22,359
This is the last thing I wanted to see.

256
00:22:23,160 --> 00:22:24,599
He can be eliminated.

257
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:27,519
Wait.

258
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,519
As for the people around Wei Tian,

259
00:22:33,839 --> 00:22:35,319
don't wipe them all out at once.

260
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:37,440
I must honor our agreement.

261
00:22:37,759 --> 00:22:39,160
I want those around him

262
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:40,599
to die one by one.

263
00:22:40,799 --> 00:22:41,640
Understood, Boss.

264
00:22:48,559 --> 00:22:51,319
Beyond death lies paradise,

265
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:54,160
but only the living can experience

266
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:57,519
the joy and sorrow of reunion and parting.

267
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:01,200
What a beautiful thing that is.

268
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:31,599
Can I come in?

269
00:23:32,279 --> 00:23:33,079
Come on in.

270
00:23:40,599 --> 00:23:43,160
Will we ever see each other again?

271
00:23:47,960 --> 00:23:49,039
The way you put it,

272
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:50,920
makes it sound like I'm never coming back.

273
00:23:52,119 --> 00:23:53,319
It's not that serious.

274
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:01,160
How many years have we known each other?

275
00:24:07,119 --> 00:24:08,119
We've known each other...

276
00:24:08,359 --> 00:24:09,799
for quite a few years now.

277
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,400
Have you packed your luggage in the living room?

278
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:16,920
Not yet.

279
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:17,960
Then I'll go pack my things.

280
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:18,799
I'll leave you to it.

281
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:19,039
Is Rosie leaving?

282
00:25:19,039 --> 00:25:19,799
Yeah.

283
00:25:20,480 --> 00:25:22,200
Her passport is ready.

284
00:25:22,519 --> 00:25:23,519
She'll be heading home soon.

285
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:27,839
Are you really not going to see her?

286
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,480
No.

287
00:25:30,359 --> 00:25:31,960
The more I see her, the more danger she's in.

288
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:36,559
Last time, I recklessly ran to the vineyard,

289
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:38,759
danced and played music with her...

290
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:41,799
Looking back now, it feels like a dream.

291
00:25:44,039 --> 00:25:46,000
But at that moment, I forgot everything.

292
00:25:47,079 --> 00:25:48,160
She was all I could see.

293
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:53,000
You're a traitor to Hades now.

294
00:25:58,559 --> 00:25:59,559
What are your plans?

295
00:25:59,920 --> 00:26:00,960
I plan to forget her.

296
00:26:02,799 --> 00:26:05,319
And forget all the pain and misery.

297
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,000
You know what, Wei Tian?

298
00:26:09,039 --> 00:26:10,799
So many times I aimed my gun at her,

299
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:12,400
and almost shot her.

300
00:26:13,559 --> 00:26:15,200
Just thinking about it terrifies me.

301
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:17,640
I want to forget all of it.

302
00:26:18,680 --> 00:26:20,000
All I can do now...

303
00:26:20,759 --> 00:26:22,559
is become a weapon in your hands,

304
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:25,000
to protect her,

305
00:26:25,559 --> 00:26:26,559
and protect you all as well.

306
00:26:29,279 --> 00:26:30,119
I understand.

307
00:26:33,559 --> 00:26:34,759
I want to join you,

308
00:26:35,319 --> 00:26:36,359
and fight by your side.

309
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,720
Nothing unusual so far.

310
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,920
Front and rear passages are clear.

311
00:27:49,079 --> 00:27:49,880
Everyone,

312
00:27:50,759 --> 00:27:51,599
today,

313
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:56,200
we're holding a brief farewell gathering

314
00:27:57,160 --> 00:27:58,200
to send off

315
00:27:58,480 --> 00:28:00,000
a member of our family,

316
00:28:00,559 --> 00:28:04,240
our dear, beautiful Rosie, as she heads home

317
00:28:04,759 --> 00:28:07,160
to search for her roots.

318
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:10,599
Today, right here

319
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:11,720
at the Silent Protectors base,

320
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:15,519
where we've fought and lived for four years.

321
00:28:15,519 --> 00:28:16,319
Of course,

322
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:19,119
in her beautiful life,

323
00:28:19,240 --> 00:28:20,920
this is only a brief moment.

324
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:22,160
Rosie,

325
00:28:22,559 --> 00:28:25,200
it's been an honor sharing this moment with you.

326
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:28,039
The honor is mine.

327
00:28:30,039 --> 00:28:30,839
Come.

328
00:28:31,039 --> 00:28:32,039
Come on, thank you, everyone.

329
00:28:32,039 --> 00:28:33,039
Cheers, everyone!

330
00:28:53,880 --> 00:28:57,000
Rosie, are you really leaving?

331
00:28:57,319 --> 00:28:58,559
Is there really nothing here...

332
00:28:58,759 --> 00:29:00,519
...worth staying for?

333
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:02,640
Of course there is.

334
00:29:03,160 --> 00:29:04,119
All of you.

335
00:29:04,480 --> 00:29:05,799
Everyone is right here.

336
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,319
I will come back.

337
00:29:08,880 --> 00:29:11,440
Then come back as soon as you can.

338
00:29:14,559 --> 00:29:15,400
Sha Lan,

339
00:29:16,279 --> 00:29:19,000
you should visit China and try the food there too.

340
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:20,799
Otherwise, how would you know...

341
00:29:20,799 --> 00:29:22,319
...if Captain's cooking is any good?

342
00:29:23,759 --> 00:29:25,119
Going back wouldn't be much fun anyway.

343
00:29:25,119 --> 00:29:27,240
Besides, I don't really have any family there.

344
00:29:27,920 --> 00:29:29,359
I like it just fine here.

345
00:29:29,680 --> 00:29:30,640
Uncle Qu's cooking...

346
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:32,440
...is the best in the world.

347
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:33,839
Going back is no fun.

348
00:29:46,960 --> 00:29:48,400
Sha Lan feels miserable.

349
00:29:48,839 --> 00:29:49,920
It's okay, it's okay.

350
00:29:50,279 --> 00:29:51,640
Getting it out will help.

351
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:54,240
Holding it in would only make him feel worse.

352
00:29:58,319 --> 00:29:59,000
Where's Wei Tian?

353
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:00,200
Why didn't he come along

354
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,359
to see Rosie off?

355
00:30:06,880 --> 00:30:08,039
He's just like her.

356
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,559
Cold on the outside,

357
00:30:09,559 --> 00:30:11,039
but deep down,

358
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:12,240
he's actually very soft-hearted.

359
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:13,720
Pure contradiction.

360
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:17,200
I was thinking, now that Rosie's heading back home,

361
00:30:17,559 --> 00:30:19,559
won't the Silent Protectors be down a person?

362
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:20,799
It just so happens

363
00:30:20,799 --> 00:30:22,000
I could step in as a replacement!

364
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:22,720
Don't you agree?

365
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:23,720
I'm a perfect fit.

366
00:30:24,680 --> 00:30:25,480
Anda,

367
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:26,640
put in a good word for me.

368
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:34,440
If you turned that bar into a café

369
00:30:34,559 --> 00:30:36,400
and made Rosie happy,

370
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:39,920
then she might just let you join.

371
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:42,000
That's a great idea.

372
00:30:43,039 --> 00:30:45,200
If you turn your bar into a café,

373
00:30:45,559 --> 00:30:46,599
then in the future,

374
00:30:46,759 --> 00:30:48,640
I can still drop by often for coffee.

375
00:30:48,839 --> 00:30:49,720
No problem.

376
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,440
As long as I can join the Silent Protectors,

377
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:52,880
I'll do whatever you say.

378
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:54,000
I'm at your command.

379
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:55,000
All right.

380
00:30:55,559 --> 00:30:57,039
Since I ate your food,

381
00:30:57,200 --> 00:30:58,839
I suppose I should speak up for you.

382
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:00,559
From now on,

383
00:31:00,559 --> 00:31:02,119
if you ever run into any trouble,

384
00:31:02,119 --> 00:31:04,359
the Silent Protectors will definitely lend a hand.

385
00:31:05,359 --> 00:31:06,200
Cheers.

386
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,359
Thank you, Rosie, my goddess!

387
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:14,440
You're the most beautiful!

388
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:20,960
My pizza, my pizza, my pizza!

389
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:31,759
Pizza's here!

390
00:31:36,119 --> 00:31:37,440
Here comes the pizza!

391
00:31:40,319 --> 00:31:41,799
You're the first target.

392
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:43,799
Rosie,

393
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:46,079
you should be the one to cut it.

394
00:31:46,079 --> 00:31:46,720
Here you go.

395
00:32:02,559 --> 00:32:03,359
Silent Protectors.

396
00:32:03,759 --> 00:32:04,799
We're going with Plan A now.

397
00:32:04,799 --> 00:32:05,519
Copy that.

398
00:32:05,519 --> 00:32:06,200
Copy.

399
00:32:06,480 --> 00:32:07,279
Copy that.

400
00:32:14,839 --> 00:32:15,640
Wei Tian.

401
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:18,559
Looks like an acquaintance came to help this time.

402
00:32:19,279 --> 00:32:21,000
An acquaintance? What acquaintance?

403
00:32:21,359 --> 00:32:22,920
Don't tell me this is overtime for me.

404
00:32:25,079 --> 00:32:25,880
Ye Wan.

405
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:28,200
This is the first test of your graduation exam.

406
00:32:29,079 --> 00:32:30,440
Keep yourself safe.

407
00:32:31,319 --> 00:32:32,200
Don't worry.

408
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:34,759
We'll keep Zuo Feichen and Anda safe, too.

409
00:33:04,519 --> 00:33:06,440
Six o'clock, three targets.

410
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:08,000
One sniper.

411
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:09,039
Two RPGs.

412
00:33:11,359 --> 00:33:13,319
Rosie, look after the two of them.

413
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:15,720
Captain, let's move.

414
00:33:16,319 --> 00:33:17,119
Copy that.

415
00:33:17,839 --> 00:33:19,000
We'll head over first.

416
00:33:19,039 --> 00:33:20,720
Get them to safety.

417
00:33:26,640 --> 00:33:27,440
Come on.

418
00:33:27,799 --> 00:33:28,359
Keep up.

419
00:33:28,359 --> 00:33:28,880
Come on.

420
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:29,640
Move, move, move!

421
00:33:44,279 --> 00:33:45,200
What's wrong?

422
00:33:45,359 --> 00:33:46,200
Scared?

423
00:33:46,359 --> 00:33:47,160
If you're scared,

424
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:48,559
it's not too late to back out.

425
00:33:48,799 --> 00:33:50,640
I'd be lying if I said I wasn't scared.

426
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:52,200
But it's too late to back out now.

427
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:53,480
I'm with you.

428
00:33:53,799 --> 00:33:54,599
Let's go.

429
00:34:36,519 --> 00:34:38,039
Anda, you stay here.

430
00:34:38,039 --> 00:34:39,960
Make sure you stay safe.

431
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:40,960
Until you hear my cue,

432
00:34:40,960 --> 00:34:41,960
don't step outside no matter what.

433
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:43,360
We can't take any more risks.

434
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:44,639
Don't worry, Rosie.

435
00:34:44,639 --> 00:34:45,559
I'll keep myself safe.

436
00:34:45,559 --> 00:34:46,400
You be careful too.

437
00:34:48,280 --> 00:34:50,199
Sha Lan, while watching the monitors,

438
00:34:50,199 --> 00:34:51,199
keep Anda safe.

439
00:34:51,519 --> 00:34:52,960
Got it. Don't worry.

440
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,159
Stay safe.

441
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:55,199
Moving out.

442
00:34:59,679 --> 00:35:00,559
In 30 seconds,

443
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:02,360
I'll move into the open

444
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:04,159
to draw their attention.

445
00:35:04,559 --> 00:35:05,360
Do you copy?

446
00:35:05,559 --> 00:35:06,360
Copy.

447
00:35:29,559 --> 00:35:31,199
Wei Tian, doing this

448
00:35:31,199 --> 00:35:32,199
to locate the sniper

449
00:35:32,199 --> 00:35:33,159
is way too dangerous!

450
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,280
Be careful.

451
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:48,599
Wei Tian!

452
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:52,679
Wei Tian!

453
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:54,559
Please...

454
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:57,159
take good care of Ye Wan for me.

455
00:35:57,679 --> 00:35:58,480
Charon!

456
00:35:58,920 --> 00:35:59,719
Charon!

457
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:20,000
This is the magic moment I've been waiting for.

458
00:36:20,119 --> 00:36:21,519
The upcoming showdown

459
00:36:21,920 --> 00:36:23,559
is what every sniper

460
00:36:23,639 --> 00:36:26,320
spends a lifetime waiting for.

461
00:37:46,679 --> 00:37:47,480
Take cover!

462
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:52,800
Silent Protectors.

463
00:37:53,239 --> 00:37:54,039
Report your position.

464
00:37:54,039 --> 00:37:54,760
Position!

465
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:56,599
Computer room, clear.

466
00:37:56,960 --> 00:37:58,039
Anda, clear.

467
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:04,000
Base perimeter, clear.

468
00:38:04,679 --> 00:38:06,599
Charon! Charon!

469
00:38:06,599 --> 00:38:07,400
Report your position.

470
00:38:07,480 --> 00:38:08,400
Who is Charon?

471
00:38:11,199 --> 00:38:12,599
Is he the acquaintance Sha Lan mentioned?

472
00:38:14,239 --> 00:38:15,320
Who is he really?

473
00:38:16,320 --> 00:38:17,320
Calm down.

474
00:38:19,639 --> 00:38:20,559
Do you remember...

475
00:38:21,360 --> 00:38:22,360
...anyone named Qin Huan?

476
00:38:24,599 --> 00:38:26,719
Precisely because everything keeps changing,

477
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:29,559
we prefer to believe in things

478
00:38:29,559 --> 00:38:30,840
that remain constant forever.

479
00:38:33,239 --> 00:38:34,760
Like me.

480
00:38:35,079 --> 00:38:36,360
What can you actually remember?

481
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,440
You.

482
00:38:42,199 --> 00:38:43,000
I remember.

483
00:38:44,280 --> 00:38:45,079
Charon!

484
00:38:47,639 --> 00:38:50,960
Charon! Charon, do you copy?

485
00:38:56,599 --> 00:38:57,360
Charon!

486
00:38:58,599 --> 00:38:59,360
Charon!

487
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:01,639
Report your position.

488
00:39:02,679 --> 00:39:04,639
Charon, report your position.

489
00:39:06,480 --> 00:39:09,760
Charon, report your position.

490
00:39:11,679 --> 00:39:12,480
Wei Tian!

491
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:14,360
Threat eliminated.

492
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:16,960
All clear on my end.

493
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:20,159
Didn't you say I'm always careless and forgetful?

494
00:39:20,320 --> 00:39:23,119
So I had our names engraved on the necklace.

495
00:39:23,159 --> 00:39:24,159
That way, I'll never forget.

496
00:39:25,159 --> 00:39:25,960
Qin Huan.

497
00:39:27,239 --> 00:39:28,400
He was Qin Huan all along.

498
00:39:53,320 --> 00:39:54,119
Qin Huan.

499
00:39:58,199 --> 00:39:59,320
You're Qin Huan.

500
00:40:07,719 --> 00:40:09,599
Come over

501
00:40:11,079 --> 00:40:14,920
and sit by my side.

502
00:40:17,039 --> 00:40:24,559
Don't leave in such a hurry.

503
00:40:25,960 --> 00:40:32,599
Remember the Red River Valley.

504
00:40:35,760 --> 00:40:44,199
Your eyes shine brighter than the sun,

505
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:54,400
lighting up my heart.

506
00:41:30,039 --> 00:41:31,599
I really want to find

507
00:41:33,159 --> 00:41:35,000
the one I loved the most.

508
00:42:21,719 --> 00:42:22,519
Qin Huan!

509
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:27,199
Qin Huan!

510
00:42:31,320 --> 00:42:34,199
Qin Huan!
